    "detailed_description": "<h1>New puzzle!Try again!</h1><p></p><br><h1>Physical puzzle</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/876890/extras/4837160d83c1315ea12329b4fb5c6a80.poster.avif?t=1611034824\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/876890/extras/4837160d83c1315ea12329b4fb5c6a80.webm?t=1611034824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/876890/extras/a3324e7e87c7bfe5920e918d305b7618.webp?t=1611034824\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/876890/extras/76f05cc4ff3af1b1042a84a3ce9d1f23.webp?t=1611034824\" /></div><br>The second part of the game Draw It!<br>With the help of drawing and physics - help the smiley to get to the platform.<br>Draw a smiley path using geometric shapes to get to the platform!<br>Use your imagination to achieve the goal!<br>You have a huge number of options!<br>Draw and reach the goal!<br>In Draw It! 2 is even more than levels and creativity<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/876890/extras/76f05cc4ff3af1b1042a84a3ce9d1f23.webp?t=1611034824\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/876890/extras/180515cf10870e972143496a02498d14.avif?t=1611034824\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/876890/extras/76f05cc4ff3af1b1042a84a3ce9d1f23.webp?t=1611034824\" /></div><br><br><br><strong>EACH LEVEL RESTART IS UNIQUE!</strong><br><br>\u2712 77 levels!<br>\u2712 Interesting achievements!<br>\u2712 low system requirements!<br>\u2712 creativity!<br>\u2712 Drawing!<br>\u2712 Intuitive gameplay!<br>\u2712 Realistic 2d physics!<br>\u2712 funny music!<br>\u2712 very low price!<br>\u2712 mode ArcanDrawIt!<br><br>Music by bensound<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/876890/extras/76f05cc4ff3af1b1042a84a3ce9d1f23.webp?t=1611034824\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/876890/extras/ca0e5caefd3e5e6a40f78796d59d7dc3.poster.avif?t=1611034824\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/876890/extras/ca0e5caefd3e5e6a40f78796d59d7dc3.webm?t=1611034824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/876890/extras/ca0e5caefd3e5e6a40f78796d59d7dc3.mp4?t=1611034824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
